<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41921" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rŭbĭcundus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		rubeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>red</i>, <i>ruddy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rufus quidam, ore rubicundo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 4, 7, 121</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. Rud. 2, 2, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. Hec.
				3, 4, 26</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 16, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pluma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 2, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">luna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 35, 79, § 347</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Priapus,</span>”
				<i>painted red</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					6, 319</span></i>
			 (cf. ruber): Ceres, <i>ruddy</i>, for flava,
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				G. 1, 297</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caelum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Matt. 16, 2</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sabulo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 9, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">habitus cometae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 7, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
